# shared-assets.allow — assets under public/ that are byte-identical to the
# paired private original AND have been looked at and cleared.
#
# Currently EMPTY, and that is the correct state: this fork shares no image
# bytes with its private original. The only overlaps ever found were empty
# .gitkeep placeholders (every zero-length file has the same hash, so the check
# now excludes them) and public/assets/NOTES.md, which was a developer doc
# living in the served directory. It was moved to docs/ on 2026-08-07 rather
# than allowlisted — a doc that names the real client does not become safe by
# being declared safe.
#
# A hash listed here is exempt FOREVER, so add one only after looking at the file.
# Format:  <sha256>  <reason>
